---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy — AIKDP';
const description = 'Privacy policy for AIKDP browser-only AI utilities.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pathname="/privacy/" schemaType="WebPage">
  <article class="prose-like max-w-3xl space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: 2026-05-14</p>

    <p>AIKDP tools run in your browser unless a page clearly says otherwise. The MVP tools do not require accounts and do not upload your prompt text, files, or privacy-check input to our servers.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">What may be collected</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li>Standard web server request data handled by the hosting provider.</li>
      <li>Advertising data from Google AdSense, subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">Google's privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li>Tool state in URL parameters only when a tool explicitly supports shareable settings.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">What is not collected by the tools</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
      <li>Your pasted prompts.</li>
      <li>Your privacy-check text.</li>
      <li>Your generated prompt output.</li>
      <li>Your uploaded files, because the MVP AI tools do not use file uploads.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Advertising</h2>
    <p>Google AdSense may set cookies or use identifiers to serve and measure ads. You can manage ad personalization at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions can be sent through the options on the <a href="/contact/" class="text-teal-700 hover:underline">Contact</a> page.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
